{
  "id": "ROM.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "ROM",
  "reference": "Rumi 4",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida sigala Abrahamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gajeayeanaan aba badayda Abrahamuheeda was gheambaghweandeanya aba saseeda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi abeeda Abrahamu iinyas doobiiwnata aba gadiyeeda, abeeda gwandeawa gichea ghaghwara geaw, ak ea mii madeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwayiin ng'ooruutka? “Abrahamu ghamwas ASEETA, ak geanung' ghwanyas niny doobiiwnata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea siida sin gadiyeeda, ea majeanung' ghoah mushaahareadaanyi gisiitaw mwadaagha gajeanung' ghoah siileeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba siida masina gadiyeeda ghus gideaba ghoadaw doobiiwnata siida mamiisiina, abeeda masaweegeaba siisi sinung' ghoah doobiiwnata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanyaashtunu Dawdi nea gabadiischeesa siidida adaw ASEETA doobiiwnata nea masina gadiyeedeani:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi, ng'wanaweesu gearugu aba badahuuka fuga niweay ghasmeahooda, ghana eara aba heeda fuga mii eayaat ghasmeahooda? Aba gideaba geayeenyi Abrahamu sinung' ghoah masaweagaaschi doobiiwnata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda geetawdaan niny? Geataw aba mwadi ghana iing'ata beata ghasmeahooda? Mii iing'ata beata, ghwanyas nea miyeayaat ghasmeahooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwanyas ghasmeahooda ak ghoah gwadeagooda ghana mascheewda doobiiwnata mideawa aba masaweega nea mii gawa ghasmeahooda. Ak abeeda ghoah niny ghweanda fuga mideawa masaweega nea miyeayaat ghasmeahooda ak abeeda eara saawa ghwanyas doobiiwnata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gwasunu eara ghweanda ghasmeahooda, nea meakna gideaba niweay ghasmeahooda, geaghus gideaba ghwaat naweedida bea masaweega ghayi aat Abrahamu nea miyeayaat ghasmeahoodean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeleesiinda ASEETA geenyassa masaweega",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba heeleesiindida bea Abrahamu ea jeataanyiin, bea gideaba gaygwahearan ng'eanyiida mwaani aba deaweeda geataw aba doobiiwnata siitaw aba masaweegean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba iijea ghoah fuga deaweeda fuga jea gwahearaniischi, masaweega ak ghoah heeleesiinda gidamwadaagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba deaweeda dea anyareesi fih gil, aba gideaba ii manda deaweeda abeeda ea may gwanda giidiinyeanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ng'asheanji gapnu aba masaweega, ak abeeda heeleesiinda ghoang'waay geat sea dagheerjeanduumeeda, ak abeeda gamajeegiit heeleesiindida aba heeda jeacheangaaschi sean, nea meakghusa fugiga bea deaweedean ak ghwahit geabwada eara fugiga mideawa masaweega Abrahamuun, was gheambaghweandeanya eesa seaniin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gawuurji gissing'oarda bea gideaba, “Neahuuwjeey huwa ghweanda eemoojiga saang'a”, aba madeeda ASEETA ghayi mwas, adaw eaweega fuga nimeewa ak gaguursa ak ghwanung' goobiida haleanjeeda mandana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gafurda ng'asheega mwoamu eefurda, ak abeeda ghoah ghweanda eemoojiga saang'a, aba gidaghayi sinyaashta, “Ak ea gichea gwadeena diibiga jea jiila gil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niny miighabealbeal aba masaweega aba iing'ula niny saseadaanyi, sam gidasam miyeeda aba gideaba niriiksa gweanyeew bughala aba gwearguumeeda, ghana iing'ula nyoota jeata mida jeeda Sara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iisibaloola badayda ghanyea mashta aba iita heeleesiinda ASEETA, hean gamajeegiit aba masaweega, nea ghoaghaambiit ASEETA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ghwanal aba huumwa gideaba ASEETA ghoamu gwasin ng'asheega niheeleesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geanung' ghoah “masaweega aba headaanyi doobiiwnata.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ng'asheega, “sirugu aba badaydaanyi, ea meang'waara aba niny ak ghwahit,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eara aba aseasa. Gajeegooneasa aseaseeda mideawa masaweega aba ninyeeda ghayi aduuna Yesuheeda was Ng'utamiideanya jeeda miyeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geenuus aba giidiinyeanyeakaasa ak gooduudu ak geenyaschi doobiiwnata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
